{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/documentation\/OUDSThemesContract"]]},"sections":[],"kind":"article","schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/documentation\/OUDSThemesContract\/GettingStarted"},"abstract":[{"text":"How to add the package as dependency, import libraries and use theme and components for your apps.","type":"text"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/oudsthemescontract\/gettingstarted"]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Integrate OUDS","anchor":"Integrate-OUDS","level":2},{"type":"heading","text":"Use Swift Package Manager","anchor":"Use-Swift-Package-Manager","level":3},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"If you want to add the iOS library of ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"Orange Unified Design System","type":"text"}]},{"text":", you need to add our ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Swift Package"}]},{"text":" into your project.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"To do that, add a new ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"package dependency","type":"text"}]},{"text":" to your ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Xcode"}]},{"text":" project by refering to it by ","type":"text"},{"code":"github.com\/Orange-OpenSource\/ouds-ios","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"You are free to choose whether or not you want a branch or a specific tag, pick the solution you want.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"You can ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/Orange-OpenSource\/ouds-ios\/wiki\/50-%E2%80%90-About-versions,-releases-and-builds","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" for more details about versions, releases and tags. You can find release tags (e.g. ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"1.0.0","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":") and release candidates tags (e.g. ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"1.0.0-rc3"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":").","type":"text"}]},{"anchor":"Import-the-libraries-you-need","text":"Import the libraries you need","type":"heading","level":3},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"You should use one (or several) of the following imports for your needs, which are basically "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Swift Package"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" products."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"style":"tip","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"We recommend to embed in your apps only the ones you need to avoid to embed useless assets.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"aside","name":"Tip"},{"code":["import OUDSThemesContract \/\/ If you want to define your theme, use themes or OUDSThemeableView","import OUDSModules \/\/ To use modules","import OUDSComponents \/\/ To use components","import OUDSThemesOrange \/\/ To use the default Orange theme","import OUDSThemesOrangeCompact \/\/ To use the Orange Compact theme","import OUDSThemesSosh \/\/ To use the Sosh theme","import OUDSThemesWireframe \/\/ To use the Wireframe theme","import OUDSTokensComponent \/\/ If you need to override or use directly components tokens","import OUDSTokenSemantic \/\/ If you need to override or use directly semantic tokens","import OUDSTokensRaw \/\/ If you need to override or use directly raw tokens","import OUDSFoundations \/\/ For some utilities"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"anchor":"Or-more-simple-import-umbrella-library","text":"Or more simple, import umbrella library","type":"heading","level":3},{"style":"note","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"We do not recommend this solution because from our point of view use of tailored imports is better to import only the needed elements.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"use of umbrella products can increase app sizes and needed storage because it emebds plenty of assets (images, fonts, etc.)","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and useless constants.","type":"text"}]}],"type":"aside","name":"Note"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Import the ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Swift Package"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" product which suits your needs:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"rows":[[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Umbrella"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Description"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"OUDSSwiftUI","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"All libraries listed above and all themes"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"OUDSSwiftUIOrange","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"All libraries listed above but with only Orange and Orange Compact themes"}]}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDSSwiftUIWireframe"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"All libraries listed above but with only Wireframe theme","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDSSwiftUIOrangeSosh"}]}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"All libraries listed above but with only Orange and Sosh themes","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]]],"header":"row","type":"table"},{"text":"Special case of XCFramework","level":3,"type":"heading","anchor":"Special-case-of-XCFramework"},{"style":"note","type":"aside","name":"Note","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The prefered solution to use OUDS is to use Swift Package Manager and pull sources from the repository to compile the project.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"XCFramework can be used by picked assets from GitHub Releases artifacts.","type":"text"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If the XCFramework is used, i.e. the one only for iOS with only Orange and Sosh themes:"}]},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"add all the atomical XCFrameworks in the project","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"import "},{"code":"OUDSSwiftUIOrangeSosh","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Chose your theme","anchor":"Chose-your-theme"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"Orange Unified Design System","type":"text"}]},{"text":" framework provides today four themes:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"header":"row","type":"table","rows":[[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Theme"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Description","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Orange","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The default one for Orange products and can be enriched \/ derivated"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Orange Compact","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"For some Orange products with heavy \/ rich UI and dimensions constraints","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Sosh"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"For Sosh products","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Wireframe"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For mockups, prototypes and prooves of concepts witouth Orange-flavoured styles"}]}]]]},{"level":3,"text":"Apply a theme","anchor":"Apply-a-theme","type":"heading"},{"numberOfColumns":2,"columns":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"You will need to use for your application root view the ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"https:\/\/ios.unified-design-system.orange.com\/documentation\/ouds\/oudsthemeableview\/","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":".","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"https:\/\/ios.unified-design-system.orange.com\/documentation\/ouds\/themes","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" also.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"This special view is here to define some elements as environment variables and injects the choosen theme.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"size":1},{"content":[{"syntax":"swift","code":["@main","struct YourApp: App {","    var body: some Scene {","       WindowGroup {","          OUDSThemeableView(theme: OrangeTheme()) {","                \/\/ Your root view","          }","       }","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing"}],"size":1}],"type":"row"},{"numberOfColumns":2,"columns":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Then get the current applied theme in your views and use the tokens you want.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The tokens are wrapped in providers with clear names, you only need to choose the ones you want.","type":"text"}]}],"size":1},{"content":[{"code":["\/\/ Use it in views as an environment variable","@Environment(\\.theme) var theme"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"}],"size":1}],"type":"row"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Keep in mind only one theme can be used within one ","type":"text"},{"code":"OUDSThemeableView","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"style":"tip","name":"Tip","type":"aside"},{"text":"Trick for Xcode Preview","anchor":"Trick-for-Xcode-Preview","level":3,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If you use Xcode "},{"code":"#Preview","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" blocks, you will have to be sure the theme is instanciated and injected through the "},{"code":"OUDSThemeableView","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Because it is not possible today to override the legit "},{"code":"#Preview","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" block, you can instead use some of our utilities to wrap your content"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"inside the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSThemeableView"},{"type":"text","text":" automatically. These utilities come with the themes modules. Without them you may face errors about undefined theme."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["\/\/ Apply Orange theme","#Preview {","    SampleView()","        .orangePreview()","}","","\/\/ Apply Orange Compact theme","#Preview {","    SampleView()","        .orangeCompactPreview()","}","","\/\/ Apply Sosh theme","#Preview {","    SampleView()","        .soshPreview()","}","","\/\/ Apply Wireframe theme","#Preview {","    SampleView()","        .wireframePreview()","}"],"type":"codeListing"}]}],"metadata":{"images":[{"identifier":"ic_unified_ds.png","type":"icon"},{"identifier":"ic_unified_ds.png","type":"card"}],"modules":[{"name":"Welcome to Orange Unified Design System"}],"roleHeading":"Article","title":"Getting Started with OUDS","role":"article"},"seeAlsoSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/documentation\/OUDSThemesContract\/Tokens","doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/documentation\/OUDSThemesContract\/Themes","doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/documentation\/OUDSThemesContract\/Components","doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/documentation\/OUDSThemesContract\/Modules"],"title":"Essentials","anchor":"Essentials","generated":true}],"references":{"doc://OUDSThemesContract/documentation/OUDSThemesContract/Modules":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"module","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" can be seen as a set of features and components to fill a need."}],"kind":"article","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/documentation\/OUDSThemesContract\/Modules","url":"\/documentation\/oudsthemescontract\/modules","title":"Modules","role":"article","type":"topic","images":[{"identifier":"ic_module_intro.png","type":"icon"},{"identifier":"ic_module_intro.png","type":"card"}]},"ic_module_intro.png":{"type":"image","variants":[{"traits":["1x","light"],"url":"\/images\/OUDSThemesContract\/ic_module_intro.png"}],"alt":null,"identifier":"ic_module_intro.png"},"doc://OUDSThemesContract/documentation/OUDSThemesContract/Tokens":{"images":[{"identifier":"ic_design_token_intro.png","type":"icon"},{"type":"card","identifier":"ic_design_token_intro.png"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/documentation\/OUDSThemesContract\/Tokens","type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"Design tokens represent the small, repeated design decisions that make up a design system’s visual style. Tokens wrap hard-coded static values, such as hexadecimal codes for color, with self-explanatory names. They are used to define the look and feel and the style of everything. They are exposed through the themes and can be used as they are.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oudsthemescontract\/tokens","role":"article","title":"Tokens","kind":"article"},"https://ios.unified-design-system.orange.com/documentation/ouds/themes":{"identifier":"https:\/\/ios.unified-design-system.orange.com\/documentation\/ouds\/themes","titleInlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This page may help"}],"url":"https:\/\/ios.unified-design-system.orange.com\/documentation\/ouds\/themes","title":"This page may help","type":"link"},"ic_component_intro.png":{"alt":null,"identifier":"ic_component_intro.png","type":"image","variants":[{"traits":["1x","light"],"url":"\/images\/OUDSThemesContract\/ic_component_intro.png"}]},"doc://OUDSThemesContract/documentation/OUDSThemesContract/Components":{"role":"article","type":"topic","images":[{"identifier":"ic_component_intro.png","type":"icon"},{"identifier":"ic_component_intro.png","type":"card"}],"abstract":[{"inlineCont